# Scratch Workflow/template orchestration scripts (root-level _*.js) — session
# scratch, never committed (ORGANIC #720). Anchored to root so it does NOT match
# tracked source like vibe-ic-marketplace/.../mcp-eda/src/devices/_registry.js.
/_*.js
# …and the rest of the same category, which #720 did not cover because it fixed
# the extension it happened to meet. Measured 2026-07-30: four scratch paths
# sitting untracked-and-unignored in the working tree for 3 to 9 days —
# `scratchpad/`, `scratchpad_pr487_msg.txt`, `_gds_closure/`, and
# `vibe-ic-marketplace/scratch_geom_signoff_tests/`.
#
# Untracked-but-not-ignored is the state one `git add -A` turns into a commit,
# which is precisely why this repo forbids `-A` — and a rule nobody has to
# remember is better than a rule everybody must. Anchored the same way, so a
# tracked `scratch`-named source file elsewhere is unaffected.
/scratchpad
/scratchpad*/
/scratchpad_*
/_gds_closure/
scratch_geom_signoff_tests/
history.md

# Local benchmark RUN PRODUCTS are never committed wholesale — only a curated,
# NDA-scrubbed results-only subset is (each shipped run dir carries its own
# .gitignore whitelisting just its RESULT.md + clean report JSONs). A raw local
# run dir can carry the commercial-PDK identifier in its own NAME, so leaving
# these untracked-but-not-ignored is one `git add -A` away from re-leaking what
# the 2026-07-19/20 history rewrite removed. Ignore raw run dirs by default;
# a curated run is added explicitly with `git add <path>` (never -A).
benchmark-data/ic/*/clean_run_*/
!benchmark-data/ic/*/clean_run_*/.gitignore
!benchmark-data/ic/*/clean_run_*/RESULT.md
!benchmark-data/ic/*/clean_run_*/reports/
# Vendored upstream benchmark datasets — large, and not ours to redistribute.
benchmark-data/datasets/

# --- benchmark-data 收斂證據的 physical 產物（2026-07-25）---
# 小 cell 的 GDS/DEF/SPEF 只有 KB-MB（spm GDS 最大 1.2MB），該進 git 讓交付包可從
# netlist 重建到 GDS。大 die 的大檔（>50MB）改走 git-lfs / GitHub Release（sha256
# 存 MANIFEST）。
#
# 2026-07-26（#419）：上面這段原本寫「由 benchmark_evidence_structure_check 的
# size-guard 擋」——那個 guard 從來沒有被寫出來，那句話就是全部的實作。實測：
# benchmark-data/ic 下有十個未追蹤的 *.gds 介於 74–105 MB，全部被這裡的 negation
# 放行，其中兩個超過 GitHub 每檔 100 MB 的硬限（push 會在物件已經進入本地歷史之後
# 才被拒絕）。真正的 guard 現在存在，叫 programs/tracked_blob_size_guard.py，接在
# tools/ci/repo_hygiene_gates.sh 裡；publisher 與 structure-check 也改成依大小
# 路由，四者的一致性由 programs/size_policy_drift_check.py 把關。
!benchmark-data/ic/**/*.gds
!benchmark-data/ic/**/*.def

# The `*.gds` rule above says what it is for: "EDA tool outputs (large,
# regeneratable)". A TEST FIXTURE is neither — it is source, it is 454 bytes,
# and no tool produces it. `filled.gds` is the layout carrying dummy-fill
# shapes that makes vibe-ic#990 falsifiable at all (see the fixture module's
# own docstring); a checkout without it cannot run that test, and generating
# it at test time instead would leave nothing a reviewer can open in KLayout.
#
# NARROW BY CONSTRUCTION: one exact path, in the same shape as the two
# negations above, not a `tests/**` sweep. A stray tool output landing in a
# test directory stays ignored.
!vibe-ic-marketplace/plugins/vibe-ic/programs/tests/fixtures/density_fill/filled.gds

# 2026-08-21 fleet run-folder triage, the same hole as #361 one more time.
# `docs/research/fleet_run_folder_triage_evidence/` holds the ONLY surviving
# copy of content lifted out of run folders that were then removed: an agent's
# `agent.log` / `iter*.log` narrative of a round, a `history.md`. `*.log` at
# line 31 silently dropped 31 of the 88 files and `history.md` at 156 dropped
# one more; `git add` reported success and the doc would have cited files that
# were never committed, after the folders holding them had been deleted.
# MEASURED: 89 files on disk, 57 staged, before this rule.
!docs/research/fleet_run_folder_triage_evidence/**
